  m_text: "Welcome to Medical Run! Your objective is to espace a maze filled with
    viruses that want to get in your way but remember you only have a short amount
    of time! Some viruses will slow you down while some will take away one of your
    health points(Brainkiller : Lose game , Spot: Lose 15 seconds , One Eye : Lose
    health point). Luckily there are medicines that speed you up/give you immunity
    against the viruses(Red : Immunity, Yellow : 1 Health point, Purple : Add 10
    seconds).\nUse WASD keys to navigate through the maze and Space to pause the
    game if you need to.\n\t\n\t\t\t\tGood luck!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
